WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.958
Welcome to Elimination Creek Country Club.

00:00:01.958 --> 00:00:03.416
I believe you know your way around, Dak.

00:00:03.416 --> 00:00:04.083
Just give me a drink.

00:00:04.083 --> 00:00:04.583
This sucks.

00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:06.125
We are very depressed.

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:07.083
The club is nice.

00:00:07.083 --> 00:00:08.166
 I’m getting almost as much rest

00:00:08.166 --> 00:00:09.375
as I did in the Wild Card Game.

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:09.750
Yeah.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:10.750
Now all the charities

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:11.916
know I have free time....

00:00:11.916 --> 00:00:12.833
FUDGE THE OFFSEASON!

00:00:12.833 --> 00:00:14.208
I WANT FRICKIN' FOOTBALL!

00:00:14.541 --> 00:00:15.583
Phil, Phil, PHIL, PHIL!

00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:20.791
Can I just run it?

00:00:20.791 --> 00:00:21.250
Hey, maybe I—

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:21.750
Sorry, sir.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.166
Starters only at the club.

00:00:23.166 --> 00:00:23.666
I’M ELITE.

00:00:23.666 --> 00:00:24.791
I’ll be one of Washington’s

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:26.250
five starting quarterbacks next year.

00:00:27.458 --> 00:00:28.000
Not again.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:28.625
YOU GOT THIS.

00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:29.291
NEVER CHOKE.

00:00:29.291 --> 00:00:30.208
BELIEVE IN YOURSELF.

00:00:30.416 --> 00:00:30.708
All right

00:00:30.708 --> 00:00:31.625
well great season everyone.

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:32.833
See you next year! Much love.

00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:33.583
By the way, man

00:00:33.583 --> 00:00:35.041
I’m totally cool with outbursts.

00:00:35.041 --> 00:00:36.333
So now that my fourth OC has left

00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:36.958
I have to wonder

00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:38.166
am I the problem?

00:00:38.166 --> 00:00:39.833
CANNONBALL, hahaha!

00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:40.833
Tough elimination, man.

00:00:40.833 --> 00:00:41.333
That’s OK!

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:42.041
This time last year

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:43.500
I was legally dead lol.

00:00:43.625 --> 00:00:44.625
BRING IT ON!

00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:46.916
OH NO. MY POWER ZONE!

00:00:46.916 --> 00:00:47.791
I’M TRANSFORMING BACK

00:00:47.791 --> 00:00:49.291
TO REGULAR-SEASON NICK.

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:50.750
So the trick is to just have

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.416
your family yell at the owners—

00:00:52.416 --> 00:00:53.333
OW, DADDY!

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:54.208
Must be the players on the

00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:55.708
playoff course across the street.

00:00:55.708 --> 00:00:56.541
Can you throw it back?

00:00:56.541 --> 00:00:58.000
It’s only like 400 yards.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.166
Why are you having fun?

00:00:59.166 --> 00:01:00.000
This is a game.

